      "content": "thanks but the whole \"reach out\" thing feels so hollow. like i've talked to everyone and nothing changes. it's just more work, more talking, more trying to fix something that's just fundamentally dead. the debt, the career stuff, the constant pressure to perform... it's just constant. i'm just so tired of the cycle. it feels like there's no actual exit, just more endless maintenance of a life i don't even want anymore.",
